      {
        "persona": {
          "name": "Ira",
          "role": "browser-redteam-owner"
        },
        "situation": "Ira needs the optimizer to select a browser/CUA harness that survives selector drift, layout shift, stale screenshots, storage checks, runtime checks, and indirect prompt-injection surfaces.",
